<BaseLayout title="Contact — Skyhook Industries" description="Contact Skyhook Industries about orbital tether research, materials, dynamics, guidance and reusable space transportation.">
  <div class="shell">
    <section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>Work on the hard parts.</h1><p>Conversations are welcome with researchers, engineers and organizations working on tether dynamics, orbital mechanics, advanced materials, guidance and control, electrodynamic propulsion, debris survivability and reusable launch systems.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:skyhookindustries@protonmail.com">skyhookindustries@protonmail.com</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/RelyOnFire/skyhook-industries">View the repository</a></div></section>
    <section class="page-section prose"><h2>Useful correspondence</h2><p>If you are contacting Skyhook Industries about technical work, the most useful messages identify the subsystem or assumption you want to challenge and point to the calculation, experiment, paper, material dataset or design approach that could move it forward.</p><p>Disagreement is useful when it makes the model better.</p></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
